==English==

===Etymology===
{{m|en|frame|pos=noun}} + {{m|en|of}} + {{m|en|reference|pos=noun}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[frame]] of [[reference]]|frames of reference}}

# a [[set]] of [[assumption]]s, [[idea]]s and [[standard]]s that form a [[viewpoint]] from which [[philosophical]], [[religious]] and other ideas may be [[evaluated]]
# {{context|physics|lang=en}} a set of [[axes]] which enable an [[observer]] to [[measure]] the [[position]] and [[motion]] of all [[bodies]] in some [[system]] [[relative]] to the reference frame

